### 1. Valid create
POST http://localhost:8080/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lina",
  "salary": 2500
}

### 2. Salary as text
POST http://localhost:8080/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Omar",
  "salary": "2500"
}

### 3. Typo in field name
POST http://localhost:8080/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Omar",
  "salry": 2500
}

### 4. Client sends its own id
POST http://localhost:8080/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 999,
  "name": "Omar",
  "salary": 2500
}

### 5. Decimal id
GET http://localhost:8080/employees/1.5

### 6. Method not in the spec
PATCH http://localhost:8080/employees/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "salary": 5000
}